    "decoder_context": [
      "E is a complete finite-dimensional real inner-product space, with Borel measurable structure and canonical Lebesgue volume, including dimension zero. alpha,beta are nonnegative reals (NNReal). Every binder/let is part of the exact theorem contract.",
